  # Missile Weapons Specifications
  Notes:
  - Munition range &amp; ammo capacity is taken from the standard magazine &amp; ammunition that comes loaded with the weapon.
  - For munitions that accelerate over time (such as missiles), range is an estimate based on acceleration, max velocity, and lifetime.
  - For burst-fire weapons, firerate shows burst RPS (shots per burst / cooldown).
  - RPS may not be accurate due to it being capped by server tick speed (usually 20 or 30 ticks/second).

